### ===== GENRES =====

### Создать жанры
POST http://localhost:3000/api/genres
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Боевик"
}

###
POST http://localhost:3000/api/genres
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Комедия"
}

###
POST http://localhost:3000/api/genres
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Драма"
}

###
POST http://localhost:3000/api/genres
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Фантастика"
}

###
POST http://localhost:3000/api/genres
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ужасы"
}

### Получить все жанры
GET http://localhost:3000/api/genres

### Получить жанр по ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/genres/1

### Обновить жанр
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/genres/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Боевик/Экшен"
}

### Несуществующий жанр
GET http://localhost:3000/api/genres/999


### ===== MOVIES =====

### Создать фильмы
POST http://localhost:3000/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "year": 2010,
  "description": "A thief who steals corporate secrets through dream-sharing technology"
}

###
POST http://localhost:3000/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Matrix",
  "director": "Wachowski Sisters",
  "year": 1999,
  "description": "A computer programmer discovers the world is a simulation"
}

###
POST http://localhost:3000/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Interstellar",
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "year": 2014,
  "description": "A team of explorers travel through a wormhole in space"
}

###
POST http://localhost:3000/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dune",
  "director": "Denis Villeneuve",
  "year": 2021,
  "description": "A noble family becomes embroiled in a war for control of a desert planet"
}

###
POST http://localhost:3000/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Parasite",
  "director": "Bong Joon-ho",
  "year": 2019,
  "description": "Greed and class discrimination threaten a symbiotic relationship"
}

### Получить все фильмы
GET http://localhost:3000/api/movies

### Получить фильм по ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/movies/1

### Отметить просмотренным + оценить
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isWatched": true,
  "rating": 9
}

### Добавить заметку
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/movies/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isWatched": true,
  "rating": 10,
  "notes": "Лучший фильм про симуляцию"
}

### Несуществующий фильм
GET http://localhost:3000/api/movies/999

### Удалить фильм
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/movies/5

### Проверить что удалился
GET http://localhost:3000/api/movies

### Создать фильмы
POST http://localhost:3000/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "кей-поп",
  "director": "Сони",
  "year": 2025,
  "description": "мульт"
}